nameRu":"Ворон-фамильяр","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/hornet/hornet_crow.png","className":"citadel_ability_hornet_sting","description":"Your crow familiar deals <span class=\"highlight\">impact damage</span>, reduces their bullet resist and applies a <span class=\"highlight\">bleed</span> that deals damage based on the <span class=\"highlight\">target's current health</span>.","descriptionRu":"Ворон-фамильяр <span class=\"highlight\">наносит урон при попадании</span>, уменьшает сопротивляемость цели пулям и вызывает <span class=\"highlight\">кровотечение</span>, урон которого пропорционален <span class=\"highlight\">текущему здоровью цели</span>.","abilityType":"signature"},{"id":"775377419","name":"Assassinate","nameRu":"Контрольный выстрел","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/abilities/hornet/hornet_assassinate.png","className":"citadel_ability_hornet_snipe","description":"Use your scoped rifle to fire a powerful shot over long distances. Deal only partial damage until fully charged after 1.0s of being scoped. Does <span class=\"highlight\">bonus damage</span> to enemies with <span class=\"highlight\">less than 50% health</span> remaining. Landing a killing blow on a player with Assassinate <span class=\"highlight\">grants you bonus weapon damage</span>.","descriptionRu":"Виндикта совершает из своей винтовки мощный дальний выстрел. Если он производится до накопления полного заряда (раньше чем через 1.0 сек. после взгляда в прицел), урона наносится меньше. Врагам, у которых <span class=\"highlight\">меньше 50% здоровья</span>, наносится <span class=\"highlight\">дополнительный урон</span>. Если выстрел оказывается смертельным, Виндикта <span class=\"highlight\">получает бонус к урону от оружия</span>.","abilityType":"ultimate"},{"id":"2573821048","name":"Knocked off Zipline","nameRu":"Падение с зиплайна","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_zip_line","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1466127517","name":"Jump","nameRu":"Прыжок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_jump","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2335418656","name":"Slide","nameRu":"Скольжение","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_slide","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"875395762","name":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/images/upgrades/mods_utility/zipline_mastery.png","className":"citadel_ability_zipline_boost","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4109126631","name":"Mantle","nameRu":"Преодоление препятствия","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_mantle","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"4261702459","name":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_climb_rope","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"1443159618","name":"","image":"https://assets-bucket.deadlock-api.com/assets-api-res/icons/hud/icons/icon_speed.svg","className":"citadel_ability_sprint","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"2207638101","name":"Dash","nameRu":"Рывок","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_dash","description":"","abilityType":"innate"},{"id":"664285540","name":"Parry","nameRu":"Парирование","image":"","className":"citadel_ability_melee_parry","description":"","abilityType":"innate"}],"updatedAt":"2026-11-16T00:40:19.919Z"}}